# Side B level 1, Down the Drain (NATHAN_SIDE_B=1), for `scripts/record-run --capture`: Han
# walks it alone, the player only calls the band from the set list (Left/Right picks, Down
# calls). A wrong call (or none) and Han comes off worst; the level rewinds, set list and all.

# Try 1: no music. Han charges the giant wall and knocks himself out.
wait 6

# Try 2: Giant Steps, and nothing for the gap. A long way down.
wait 300ms
tap Down
wait 7

# Try 3: Giant Steps for the wall, fired up on top of it for the gap.
wait 200ms
tap Down
wait 2800ms
tap Right
wait 200ms
tap Down
wait 9
